# Tuple type annotation: [Tuple T0 T1 ...] resolves to a closed record with
# integer-string field names {0: T0, 1: T1, ...}. This matches the evaluation
# model where tuples are dicts with integer keys.
# A positional dict [42 "hello"] has auto-indexed keys "0" and "1" at the type
# level, matching the Tuple annotation {0: Int, 1: Str}.
[@[[Tuple Int Str]] [42 "hello"]]
=== out
Dict({"0": Int(42), "1": String("hello")})
